","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"+7ANW"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b7b04082-8a04-4ebb-8a5c-0fbf7b75d6c2","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"UNIX 形式にしてもダメなんですよね。今の所 errorformat で end_line と end_col を取る方法がなくて…","ts":"1629425521.010700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"=a5Zr"}]},{"client_msg_id":"756cb7b5-44dd-4533-972d-2f8dbf430371","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"jq か何かを使って UNIX 形式にするしかないかも。","ts":"1629425442.010000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"b0t"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0bb0f025-7e29-42e2-b0f6-83765f4b1e1d","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"errorformats を軽くみたけど JSON を読み込んでは無さそう。","ts":"1629425416.009600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"BsnG"}]},{"client_msg_id":"16ef4a52-b248-4873-9004-e53f2f49da2b","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"lsp は関係ないけど、Vim 本体にも `%J` みたいなのがあっても良さそうな気がしています (文法をどうするかは悩ましい)","ts":"1629425368.009200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"32Rfk"}]},{"client_msg_id":"24d518e0-2a4a-43c6-a220-414fac0d707d","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"あ、いや。 errorformats.NewScanner 次第か。","ts":"1629425323.008500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"gDw"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f3f8f1fb-4701-466b-ae02-0c01796a32b8","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"JSON 自体は 1 行なんですけど、そこに全部のエラーが入っている感じですね…","ts":"1629425319.008400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Ldb"}]},{"client_msg_id":"31ecbd5a-41ad-49cd-bdc6-181db3c0af9d","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"いまのところ、efm-langserver は行毎の処理なので、1行 JSON なら可能性あるけどそう